    "description": "Buổi 49 theo syllabus FLM.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VNC104 · Chapter 8 · Session 49</span>\n<h2>Session 49 — Field-trip</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13353 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">VNC104 · Chương 8 · Buổi 49</span>\n<h2>Buổi 49 — Field-trip</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13353 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Field-trip</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>The lecturer organized a field trip for students in one of the following places:<br>-Chinatown<br>- Ao dai Museum<br>Or teacher's recommendation.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Individual Assignment 2: Students do extra-curricular harvest reports.<br>Essay exercise: Students choose a phenomenon, an observed symbol in the extracurricular session to point out the characteristics of Vietnamese culture.<br>Requirements: 1. Students choose a phenomenon, 1 cultural symbol observed in extracurricular activities.<br>2. From there, analyzing to see the basic characteristics of the culture in Vietnam.<br>Evaluation criteria: + Choose a good phenomenon or symbol: 2/10 + Analyze well and point out the characteristics: 6/10 + The layout of the article is scientific, clear and coherent: 2/10</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GD_QN40.1</strong> — How have Vietnamese people taken advantage of the natural environment in their culinary Culture?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
